
# ── Commit Message Template ──────────────────────────────
# type(scope): subject
#
# Types: feat, fix, refactor, docs, test, chore, perf, ci
# Scope: backend, frontend, engines, db, config, docs
#
# Example:
#   fix(engines): add feature hash validation on model load
#   feat(frontend): add ErrorBoundary component
#   docs(readme): rewrite setup instructions
#
# Body (optional): Explain what changed and why.
# Footer (optional): BREAKING CHANGE: ... or Closes #123
